		(property "Design Note" "REF3425 output capacitor. SBAS804G gives a stable CL range of 0.1 to 10 uF, so the 4.7 uF already on this node carries over unchanged -- and the R31 that used to isolate it from the AZ431 cathode is DELETED, because that resistor existed to keep a SHUNT out of its unstable band and would now sit in series with a series reference's output, adding IR drop to the one node whose accuracy this part exists to provide"
