		(property "Design Note" "VIN monitor divider, was 130k/20k, then 82k/10k. 91k is the SAME ORDERED LINE as R43/R44 and that is the only reason it is 91k rather than 82k -- either is adequate for a supply monitor. FIRMWARE: ratio is 10/101 = 0.0990, so 15V maps to 1.485V and 7V to 0.693V, both inside the 3.3V ADC, and source impedance is 9.0k. hw_contract.h is GENERATED from these values, so the firmware follows the change instead of silently rescaling"
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "8b9b37bc-78b3-50dc-b03e-2f5283585d3d")
			(effects
