		(property "Design Note" "The ONLY thing between the AFE and the buck now that the analog LDO is gone, so it is no longer a nicety. With C7 = 10 uF it is fc ~1.59 kHz, which is 0.017 dB at 100 Hz -- it is NOT a filter against PFM burst content, and nothing here claims it is. The footprint still takes a characterized bead or 0R; choose it from the measured rail spectrum, not from this value"
