		(property "Design Note" "ADC anti-alias/input-kickback filter. PLACE WITH C28 AT THE MCU, pin 20 / PB1 / ADC_IN9 -- not at U8 AIN0, which is where this note said until 2026-09-12 and which no longer exists. The 100 nF must be close to the SAMPLING pin because what it sources is the charge kick of the SAR's 5 pF sample capacitor (DS12232 Table 58); placed at the far end it filters the signal but not the kick"
